flowchart TD
    Change["Development changes"] --> Main["Push directly to main"]
    Change --> PR["Optionally open a PR targeting main"]
    PR --> Core["Automatic Core checks · Windows / macOS / Linux"]
    Manual["Run Desktop Full manually"] --> Target["main or an open PR's merge commit"]
    Target --> Full["Core + development app and package integration checks · 3 OSes"]
    Release["Run Desktop release manually on main"] --> Bump["Select patch / minor / major"]
    Bump --> Verify["Core · packaging · security checks"]
    Verify --> Publish["Version commit + v-tag + GitHub Release"]
